a cosa che Klara ascolta è il suo programma radiofonico preferito. \"Segui la mia voce\". Tuttavia, un giorno, si chiede: è possibile innamorarsi di qualcuno che ha sentito alla radio ma che non ha mai incontrato di persona? Potrebbe davvero provare qualcosa per Kang, lo speaker del programma radiofonico?"},{"language":"en-US","title":"Follow My Voice","overview":"After a health crisis that keeps her home, Klara does nothing but listen to her favorite radio show, Follow My Voice. But one day she wonders: is it possible to fall in love with someone she has only heard on the radio but never met? Could she really have feelings for Kang, the radio show host whose voice she has only heard once, and will she overcome her fears to step out into the world again?"},{"language":"es-ES","overview":"Tras una crisis de salud que la mantiene en casa 76 días seguidos, Klara no hace otra cosa que escuchar su programa de radio favorito, \"Sigue Mi Voz\". Pero un día se pregunta: ¿es posible enamorarse de alguien a quien ha oído en la radio, pero nunca ha conocido? ¿Puede realmente sentir algo por Kang, el presentador del programa de radio, superará sus miedos y saldrá de nuevo al mundo?"}],"images":{"logos":[],"posters":[],"backdrops":[]},"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/abp7UjNegChUiciPgSBRC2acBCc.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/vcrwsAYYYmVLX0c7iFqlV1pZRdT.jpg","seasons":[],"schema":{}}},"artworkLibrary":{"tmdb":{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"tmdb","id":1144443,"type":"movie","originalLanguage":"es-ES","series":{"poster":{"it":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/abp7UjNegChUiciPgSBRC2acBCc.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/abp7UjNegChUiciPgSBRC2acBCc.jpg","language":"it","width":2000,"height":3000},"candidates":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/abp7UjNegChUiciPgSBRC2acBCc.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/abp7UjNegChUiciPgSBRC2acBCc